<section class="sec" id="security">
  <div class="sec-in">
    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">Built to be trusted</span>
      <h2>Your money data, protected</h2>
      <p>Automonie is designed so that the sensitive parts of your finances stay out of our hands in the first place.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="sec-grid">
      <div class="sec-card reveal">
        <div class="sec-ic"><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="5" y="11" width="14" height="10" rx="2"/><path d="M8 11V8a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v3"/></svg></div>
        <h3>We never see your bank login</h3>
        <p>Bank connections run through a licensed open-banking provider. You sign in directly with your bank, your credentials never touch our servers.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="sec-card reveal" data-d="1">
        <div class="sec-ic"><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Read-only access</h3>
        <p>A linked bank account can only be read, never debited. Automonie cannot move money out of your bank. Disconnect any time.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="sec-card reveal" data-d="2">
        <div class="sec-ic"><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3l7 4v5c0 5-3.5 8-7 9-3.5-1-7-4-7-9V7z"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Encrypted end to end</h3>
        <p>Every request is protected with 256-bit TLS encryption. Passwords are stored only as one-way salted hashes, they can't be read or recovered, even by us.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="sec-card reveal" data-d="3">
        <div class="sec-ic"><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"/><path d="M12 2v3M12 19v3M2 12h3M19 12h3"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Locked to your device</h3>
        <p>Add two-step email verification, plus a PIN or fingerprint lock on Android, so your finances stay private even if someone else picks up your phone.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="sec-card reveal" data-d="4">
        <div class="sec-ic"><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 6h18M3 12h18M3 18h10"/></svg></div>
        <h3>We don't sell your data</h3>
        <p>No advertisers, no data brokers. Your financial information is used to run the app for you, nothing else. You can export or delete it whenever you want.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="sec-card reveal" data-d="5">
        <div class="sec-ic"><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M6 3h12v18l-3-2-3 2-3-2-3 2z"/><path d="M9 9h6M9 13h6"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Licensed partners</h3>
        <p>Any bank-data or payment services are handled by regulated Nigerian providers, so the money side is run by licensed institutions, not by us alone.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="sec-note">Read the detail in our <a href="/privacy" style="color:var(--mint);font-weight:600">Privacy Policy</a> and <a href="/terms" style="color:var(--mint);font-weight:600">Terms of Service</a>.</p>
  </div>
</section>

